text.description:
{Pendant of Total Recall}

Renders your units immune to the Forgetfulness spell. Increases all experience your hero gains by 10%.

At the start of every battle casts Expert Precision on all your troops (+6 Attack to shooters, 50 rounds).

{Stoic Watchman}

Increases your Eagle Eye skill by 10% and increases your scouting radius by 10.

(WoG script02: revealed a large map area weekly.)

{Garniture of Interference}

Increases your Magic Resistance by 5% and raises the mastery of every magic school by one level.

(WoG script02: could be traded to learn a magic skill.)
